It was the first concrete testimony of the power of this sacred prayer, and the news spread quickly through the corridors of the Vatican, reaching the faithful in various parts of the world. From that moment on, I decided to publicly share the Prayer of Solomon. So that all sons and daughters of faith could experience the same divine touch we witnessed here. What happened next deeply marked my heart. We received moving reports of healings, reconciliations, and blessings granted.


And for that reason, I asked that some of these testimonies be recorded on video so that everyone could see the manifestation of God''s power with their own eyes. Now see the first account, the testimony of Sister Helena, one of the faithful who experienced a true miracle after saying this prayer. My life has never been simple. From a very young age, I embraced the religious vocation, but before that, I faced many trials. I was raised in a small village in Italy, and for years I helped my family with whatever was needed in the fields.


In cleaning, in caring for the elderly. Even after entering the convent, my heart always remained in prayer for my family, who faced hardships and lacked stability. I asked God every day to illuminate their path, but for a long time, it seemed that heaven remained silent. Then, Your Holiness returned from an apostolic journey and during a homily in the private chapel, shared with us the Prayer of Solomon. Your words touched me deeply, and I decided to begin reciting it daily, always with my heart turned toward my family and those I love.


And then, something began to change. One of my brothers, who had been unemployed for years, received an offer for a stable job in a nearby parish. My niece, who made sweets to help with household expenses, began to receive so many orders that she opened a small bakery in our village. Even my little nephew, who dreamed of studying, was blessed with a scholarship to learn languages in another country. Seeing all this happen before my eyes was like witnessing God''s own hand at work.


I, who had so often feared I would never see my family prosper, now understand that the Lord never forgot me; He was only waiting for the right moment to act. And now, every night, when I retire to my cell in the convent, I pray in silence and give thanks. Because through the prayer of Solomon, I have learned that God always listens, but one must know how to pray with the right heart. Upon hearing Sister Helena''s testimony, my heart fills with gratitude. These stories remind me, my brothers and sisters, that miracles are not relics of the past.


They continue to happen before our very eyes whenever faith is true and the heart is pure. In my more than 70 years of life, 45 of which have been dedicated to the priesthood, I must confess I have never witnessed so many signs of divine grace as those that began to appear when the Prayer of Solomon was shared with the world. And as I reflect on all of this, I cannot help but recall the luminous example of Carlo Acutis, the young blessed who devoted his brief life to bringing people closer to God through faith and technology. Carlo used to say that sadness is looking at yourself and happiness is looking at God. These words move me deeply, for they reveal the very same essence that inspired Solomon to ask not for riches but for wisdom.


Like the king, Carlo understood that true greatness does not lie in worldly things, but in communion with the divine. Both sought something that transcends time, the spiritual understanding born of love and humility. I see therefore in the prayer of Solomon the same light that shone in the heart of Carlo, a flame of pure faith that renews the human spirit and leads to grace. And I believe with all my heart that every person who opens themselves to this prayer awakens within their soul the same gift that united these 2 examples of holiness: the wisdom that comes from God and the faith that moves miracles. I describe these miracles as true turning points, transformations that can only be explained by the direct action of God.


But unfortunately, not everyone was happy about it. A few days later, members of our team began to be approached by strange individuals, people with unknown identities and intentions. These men questioned the nature of our research, made veiled threats, and clearly demonstrated that they wanted it all to stop. The next morning, our office was broken into, computers destroyed, Documents taken, several pieces of equipment disappeared, our names began to be watched. Some colleagues noticed they were being followed.


Fear took over. Some members decided to step away for their own protection. They couldn''t risk their families. And I understood them. But I knew I had to continue.


The truth we had discovered could not die with us without being shared with more people. We couldn''t give up after everything we had witnessed. These groups, these forces that operate in the shadows, feed on people''s ignorance and dependence. False prophets who profit from the Word of God, corrupt and deceitful men who build their castles of power on the shoulders of those who have little. And that is why they do not want humble people to discover that there is a way to break free from this cycle.


If each one of us learns to pray the right way, if every person gains access to the lost Prayer of Solomon, this entire structure of control would begin to crumble and they would fall with it. That is why I made the decision to continue the work in a more cautious way. We began organizing discreet gatherings in remote, safe locations far from the public eye. I invited only those who were truly committed to the mission. The prayer needed to continue spreading, but now in a protected way, away from the eyes and ears of those who wanted to silence the truth.


And that''s how we began searching for a way to make this prayer accessible to as many people as possible safely. But even with all our precautions, we knew it wouldn''t be easy. At first, we tried to share the Prayer of Solomon for free over the internet. We used messaging platforms like WhatsApp and Telegram, tried through social networks like Facebook and Instagram, recorded videos, sent files by email, but everything was taken down, silenced, or blocked. The videos disappeared, the messages stopped being delivered, Accounts were deactivated without explanation.


It seemed that with every attempt to bring the prayer to more people, someone with a lot of money and dark interests pressed a button to stop us. That''s when we realized that it was no longer enough just to have the truth in our hands. We needed to share it differently, more discreetly and securely, in a way that would allow us to reach more people without being blocked by these platforms that operate under the control and influence of those who do not want this prayer to spread. And after many meetings, sleepless nights, and countless prayers asking for God''s divine guidance, we found a definitive solution. But before I show you the solution we found, I must tell you something very important about this prayer.


