I shouldn''t be recording this video. In fact, my team begged me not to do this. They said I''m going to destroy my career and become a target for very dangerous people. But I need you to listen to me very carefully because this broadcast is hidden and could be taken offline at any moment. You probably know me as Jonathan Roumie, the actor who plays Jesus in the series The Chosen.


I decided to turn on this camera today, completely unplanned, exclusively for the United States, and I''m going to tell you exactly why. The entire world watches the series, but the messages I receive from you Americans keep me awake at night. It was the United States that showed me the most passionate faith I have ever seen in my life. But behind the scenes, I saw a desperation that broke my heart. I know what happens when you lock your bedroom door at night.


That agonizing feeling of dropping to your knees, crying with the bills in your hands, asking God for a miracle, for a way out of the debts that are suffocating you, and waking up the next day, feeling like he turned his back on you. You work yourself to exhaustion, you try to do everything right, but the weight of scarcity never leaves your shoulders. And the worst part is that quiet little voice in your head whispering, why do the wicked prosper while I, someone who has faith, live in this misery? Has God forgotten about me? I know this weight because I lived through it myself.


I am putting my face and my name at risk here today to tell you a truth that the elites of New York and the world do not want you to know. God has not forgotten you, and the fact that you are living through this hardship is not your fault. Your blessing is not blocked because of a lack of faith, it is blocked because very powerful men ripped the real key out of your hands. There is a sacred activation, a code of only 20 words that was violently hidden and removed from the Bible more than 1,000 years ago by emperors and false leaders. Why did they do this?


Because they knew one thing: if ordinary men and women, who already have hearts full of faith like the American people, had access to this original code, no one would ever be able to control them through debt, depression, and fear again. It would be an unforgivable injustice on my part to discover this, watch my life be transformed completely, and leave this divine secret locked away only for the people in power. What you are about to discover in the next few minutes is not self-help, it is not religion, and it is definitely not the Law of Attraction. It is a rescue. It is the exact frequency of prayer capable of breaking the chains of financial and spiritual misery in your life and opening doors that no man can close.


If you feel like your life is stuck, take a deep breath and pay attention. I don''t know how long I''ll be able to keep this online, but this is my gift of gratitude to you. Stay with me until the end. What I''m about to reveal to you is going to change your family''s story forever. I need to be sincere with you.


As successful as I may be today, for 20 years of my life, I was a broke actor trying to survive in New York. I went to exhausting auditions every single day only to hear no after no. I worked dead-end jobs just to pay the rent on a tiny room, and many times I had to choose between eating lunch or dinner, and what hurt me the most wasn''t the hunger or the lack of money, it was the spiritual confusion. I was a man of faith. I fasted, I got down on my knees every night and prayed with all my strength and still the doors remained locked with iron padlocks in front of me, while people around me without a shred of faith or character moved forward in life and became wealthy effortlessly.


I''m even a little embarrassed to tell you this, but there were nights when I cried alone, looked up at the ceiling and asked, God, what am I doing wrong? Have you forgotten about me? Have you abandoned me? Until about 3 years before everything changed, I reached my breaking point. It was the middle of the night and it was raining heavily in New York, in the neighborhood where I lived.


I would go out at night just to walk because I couldn''t stand the pain of crying alone at home anymore. I entered a small stone chapel that stayed open 24 hours a day on an almost deserted street. I hadn''t gone there to say a beautiful prayer. I was exhausted, broken, and hopeless. I simply fell to my knees at the back of the chapel and said a raw prayer, with no rehearsed repetitions, no complicated words.


I spoke like a wounded son who couldn''t take being beaten down by life anymore. I said, Lord, I give up trying to fight with my own strength. I''m not going to beg anymore. I just need you to show me the truth. Show me where I''m going wrong.


I closed my eyes and when I opened them, I was no longer alone. An elderly man, his overcoat wet from the rain, had stepped out of the shadows of the chapel and was standing beside me. He was out of breath, looking toward the windows as if he were afraid someone had followed him. Later I would discover that he was one of the greatest scholars of biblical manuscripts in the world. A man who had spent years in Israel, poring over the original codices of the Hebrew Bible.


He was on the run. Weeks earlier, his team''s office had been broken into in the middle of the night, computers destroyed, ancient translations stolen. Very powerful people had discovered what he was researching, and wanted to silence him at any cost. He sat down beside me, looked deep into my eyes and said something that sent a chill through my stomach. Son, I came in here to hide, but I just heard your prayer.


Do you realize what you just did? I shook my head no, and he said, you prayed with your soul torn open the way King David prayed, and that is no coincidence. I feel that even though you are nobody today, your voice will one day echo throughout the entire world. Then he opened his coat. Pulled out a small, aged leather notebook and placed it in my hands, and then he whispered, the divine connection was removed from the Bible, my son.


They taught the people to pray like slaves, always begging for crumbs, always crying. Meanwhile, they rule the world using the original words of creation. He explained to me that inside that notebook was the exact translation of 20 words removed from the Bible. The original Hebrew code that Jesus and the great prophets used more than 2,000 years ago to connect directly with the source of all provision. Then he said, before I leave, no matter how deep you are in the pit, if you pronounce this tomorrow, heaven will be forced to open for you.


Before I could ask a single question, he stood up and quickly disappeared into the rainy night. I never saw him again. I stayed there alone, holding that notebook. I had spent 20 years believing that I needed to suffer in order to be blessed. But I remembered what I had asked God for just minutes earlier.


I had asked for a sign. God had just placed the truth in my lap. The next morning, in my cramped room, I opened the notebook. The words were simple, short. It took less than a minute to recite them.


I took a deep breath and pronounced the 20 words out loud. I didn''t see angels and no beam of light came down from the ceiling, but what I physically felt was undeniable. The moment the final word left my mouth, it was as if a high-voltage cable had been connected to my spine. A wave of heat moved through my body and that tightness in my chest, the anxiety about how I was going to pay the rent, the fear of the future, the feeling of being a failure, simply evaporated. I experienced a peace I hadn''t felt since I was a child.


And in the days that followed, my reality began to change in a frightening way. It wasn''t magic; it was as if I had been walking in the dark my entire life and suddenly someone turned on the light. Before, I would wake up afraid of receiving another piece of bad news, but now good coincidences began happening one after another. Every day brought a different piece of good news, and I even stopped waking up afraid. The right people crossed my path.


An old debt I couldn''t pay was forgiven because of an error in the bank''s system, and I even received compensation for it. More than $20,000 appeared in my account out of nowhere. 2 weeks later, my phone rang with the best news of all. It was the callback from an audition I thought had gone badly; they wanted me. I had been chosen to play Jesus in the series The Chosen.


The bishop''s prophecy had come true. I, the indebted and rejected actor, had received the role that would change my family''s story, and my voice would be heard across the entire planet. Exactly as he had told me that day in the chapel. And it wasn''t because I deserved it more than you or anyone else. It was because for the first time in my life, I had used the original key to unlock the vault God had already placed in my name.


But this entire transformation left me with a question I needed to answer. How could a simple leather notebook with 20 words have the power to change my career, clear my mind and unlock my bank account in a matter of days? Was it magic? Was it some kind of esoteric trick? All these questions filled my head, but I knew one thing: it was something much bigger, much older, and undeniably biblical.


Pay very close attention now, because understanding this is the difference between continuing to live in misery and accessing the infinite abundance God set aside for you. The Bible says in the Book of Genesis that God did not build the world with tools. The power of the Word was what reigned. He said, let there be light, and light came into existence. Hebrew and Aramaic, the original languages of Scripture, are not merely languages of communication like Portuguese or English.


They are the language of material creation. Every letter, every word in these languages carries a specific vibrational frequency capable of altering the reality around you. To understand it simply, imagine that your direct connection with God is like an old radio. God''s exact frequency, the station where prosperity, healing, and blessings flow without interruption, is like station 100.0 FM, perfectly tuned, clear, without static. When Jesus, the apostles, and King David prayed using the original Hebrew words, they pressed the button and tuned directly into station 100.0 FM.


They didn''t need to scream, they didn''t need to cry or repeat the same prayer 100 times. They spoke once, and the miracle happened. Because the line was clear. But remember what I told you about the emperors and the elite who translated the Bible? They couldn''t simply destroy the scriptures because the people would rebel, so what they did was far more sinister.


They deliberately altered the translation of the most powerful prayers. They taught you to pray on a frequency of 99.8 FM, because even though it may seem almost identical, It is completely filled with static and without a direct connection to the Creator. When you pray today asking God for money, crying because of your debts, focusing on your pain, you are transmitting on the frequency of scarcity. You are screaming into a radio filled with static. And no matter how loudly you scream, no matter how many sleepless nights you spend repeating the rosary or crying out, your voice does not break through the barrier.


The Hebrew manuscript the bishop gave me proves a spiritual principle: the more you repeat a prayer crying out about your pain, the more you signal to the universe that you do not have faith, because that is desperation, not belief, and that makes the prayer lose its power. You don''t need to pray 50 times. The Creator of the Universe is not deaf. You only need to pray once, but using the right key for the right lock. The 20 secret words the Bishop recovered are exactly that.


They are not a desperate request. They are an alignment code. When you pronounce these original words, their sound vibration bypasses the static of the world and tunes your mind and your spirit directly into God''s original manifestation. They reorganize your life and place you on the same frequency as divine abundance. It''s like turning the master key in the door of the vault that holds your spiritual and financial inheritance.


When I understood the power of what I had in my hands, I felt a chill, and I admit I felt afraid. The miracle had happened in my life. I had been cast in the chosen The anxiety was gone, money was coming in, but a cruel question kept pounding inside my head. Did this only work for me because I was an actor? Was it an isolated miracle, or does this sacred code work for anyone, no matter how deeply buried in problems they may be?


I needed to know for sure. I couldn''t keep something like this only to myself. So I made a risky decision. I selected 3 people from my closest circle, people I loved deeply but who were living through true nightmares on Earth, people who had already tried everything and no longer had the strength even to pray. I met with each of them in secret.


I gave them the notebook containing the translation of the 20 words and gave them one instruction. Just read this out loud once a day for the next 7 days. You don''t need to beg, just read it. The results that came back to me weren''t just fast, they were frightening. The first person was a close friend of mine, Carlos.


