That financial pressure was destroying the peace inside our home, and eventually there was nothing left. I recited the 20 words on a Tuesday night, and I''m going to be honest with you, I didn''t even have that much faith in it at the time. I was desperate, you understand? I read it because I had nothing else left to do. But in less than 7 days, the impossible happened.


My phone rang with a job opportunity I hadn''t even applied for. And it wasn''t just any job. It was a position paying 3 times what I used to make. Money started coming in so unexpectedly that in that same month, I paid off all my debts. And I got my peace back.


I got my dignity back so I could look my wife in the eyes again. The second person was Patricia, a friend I consider like a sister. Patricia didn''t have money problems. Her enemy was invisible. I lived on the edge of depression.


